---
.title = "Iterate arguments",
.date = "2026-09-02",
.author = "muhammadSwa",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

Read arguments lazily with [`std.process.Args.iterate`]. As with `13-02`/`13-03`, this uses [`std.process.Init`] and `init.minimal.args`. Each `next()` yields a `[]const u8` or `null` at the end; call `skip()` to drop the program name and `deinit()` when done.

[]($code.siteAsset('src/13-04.zig').language('zig'))

